          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:742.4346923828125,247.20054626464844,3142.3150634765625,3961.9576568603516",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>but they were the price of indigo which he had bought from the House of Raisins</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in addition to [indigo bought for] the aforementioned 40 dinars.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Then Joseph, too, stated: &ldquo;As to the 40 dinars</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>for which he sues me: The aforementioned 100 dinars</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I have paid to him. Moreover, he wrote a promissory note</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>for 33 \u2159 dinars and one qir\u0101\u1e6d to Sheikh Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Man\u1e63\u016br b. Azhar, which he had owed him.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I shall clear him from this debt and return to him this note,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>which he wrote for Sheikh Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r. He (Jekuthiel) owes me</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>four dinars for occasional payments made for him. There remains a debt to him</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>of 2 \u2154 + \u215b dinars. As soon as he demands payment,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I will pay in cash.&rdquo; The proceedings have been written down, etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Nethanel b. Japheth&mdash;may he rest in Eden!&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Isaac b. Samuel&mdash;may he rest in Eden! Niss\u012bm, son of the Rav Nahray&mdash;may the memory of the righteous be blessed!</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
    {
      "etag": "\"b92dbbb96a689fc641577f62ef785f11\"",
